  "mathematical_argument": "One accelerated step sends x=B(a)/D to (3x+1)/2^a0, which is the cycle value associated with rho(a); clearing D gives the rotation identity. Since D is coprime to 2 and 3, divisibility is equivalent under rotation. Iterating the affine map for u, F_u(x)=(3^r x+B(u))/2^s, k times gives the common geometric factor G=sum_j 3^(r(k-1-j))2^(sj) in both numerator and denominator.",
